# Only what the image needs (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src
!plugins
# The wheel ships these eval scripts; the datasets stay out.
!eval/*/evaluate_memorizz.py
!eval/*/download_dataset.py
!eval/*/README.md
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules
src/memorizz/ui/frontend/node_modules
